  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "0556c246-d2fd-40ac-9aa2-ef9c939879e3",
      "question": "Among the 500 most liquid US stocks, which 10 had the most sessions in 2025 with a close-to-close move of more than 10% in either direction, and what were their largest rise and fall?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-01T18:59:07.248989Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-01T19:00:27.093643Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "Among the 500 most liquid US stocks, these 10 had the most 2025 sessions with a close-to-close move exceeding 10% in either direction, along with their largest single-day rise and fall during 2025 [1].\n\n| Asset | Sessions >10% | Largest Rise | Largest Fall |\n|-------|--------------|--------------|--------------|\n| ASST | 72 | +426.8% | –31.8% |\n| CRML | 66 | +55.8% | –34.1% |\n| AAOI | 38 | +39.9% | –20.9% |\n| ASPI | 38 | +31.5% | –23.2% |\n| AEVA | 37 | +35.4% | –24.2% |\n| BBAI | 36 | +45.2% | –20.6% |\n| AMPX | 32 | +35.1% | –15.8% |\n| APLD | 32 | +47.3% | –37.7% |\n| CIFR | 32 | +22.9% | –23.2% |\n| CAN  | 31 | +40.4% | –17.2% |\n\n**Notes**\n- Returns are converted from fractions (e.g., 4.268 → 426.8%).\n- The window is calendar year 2025 (trading dates 2025-01-01 through 2025-12-31).\n- \"Sessions >10%\" counts days where the absolute daily return exceeded 10%.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Structured retrieval result — us_equities — evidence `hermes-receipt:08c30e59372a14b1d3dc8828b2e632f38cf7f28af644e4ac6129608799889725`",
