          "content": {
            "query": "Among the 500 most liquid US stocks, which 10 had the most sessions in 2025 with a close-to-close move of more than 10% in either direction, and what were their largest rise and largest fall during 2025?",
            "databaseName": "us_equities",
            "answer": "This query finds the ten most liquid US stocks that experienced the highest number of trading days in 2025 with a close-to-close price move exceeding 10% in either direction. It joins the assets and daily_prices tables, filters for liquidity_rank ≤ 500 and trading dates in 2025, then counts qualifying sessions per stock. For those top ten stocks it also returns their largest single-day gain and loss (as total_return_1d) observed during the year.",
            "sql": "WITH filtered AS ( SELECT a.asset_id, p.total_return_1d, p.trading_date FROM us_equities.main.assets AS a JOIN us_equities.main.daily_prices AS p ON a.asset_id = p.asset_id WHERE a.liquidity_rank <= 500 AND p.trading_date >= DATE '2025-01-01' AND p.trading_date < DATE '2026-01-01' ) SELECT asset_id, COUNT(CASE WHEN ABS(total_return_1d) > 0.10 THEN 1 END) AS sessions_over_10pct, MAX(total_return_1d) AS largest_rise, MIN(total_return_1d) AS largest_fall FROM filtered GROUP BY asset_id ORDER BY sessions_over_10pct DESC, asset_id LIMIT 10;",
            "rows": [
